  - key: start.tagline
    text: Practice first aid. Make you ready for work.
  - key: start.how_title
    text: How e dey work
  - key: start.how1
    text: 1. Point your phone for clear floor.
  - key: start.how2
    text: 2. Tap make the person wey fall show for floor.
  - key: start.how3
    text: 3. Follow the steps. Listen and read.
  - key: start.how4
    text: 4. Practice first. Then try the Assessment.
