  - key: scan.looking
    text: Point phone for floor. Move am slowly.
  - key: scan.keep_going
    text: Floor don show. Continue to move am.
  - key: scan.found
    text: E don ready. Tap the floor make e show.
  - key: scan.help
    text: Move phone slowly. Find floor wey get pattern or light.
  - key: place.too_small
    text: E too small. Find space like 2 by 1.5 metres.
  - key: place.placed
    text: Put the scene
  - key: place.adjust
    text: Tap floor to move am. Turn am make e lie across.
  - key: place.rotate_left
    text: Turn left
  - key: place.rotate_right
    text: Turn right
  - key: place.confirm
    text: Put am here
  - key: mode.title
    text: How you wan train?
  - key: mode.practice_desc
    text: Hint dey when you need am.
  - key: mode.assess_desc
    text: Timer dey, like real life.
  - key: mode.reposition
    text: Move scene
  - key: hud.step
    text: Step {0} for {1}
  - key: hud.pause
    text: Pause
  - key: hud.hint
    text: Show me
  - key: hud.shout
    text: 'Shout: You dey okay?'
  - key: hud.open_phone
    text: Open phone
  - key: hud.hold
    text: Hold am
  - key: hud.hazards
    text: 'Danger wey you see: {0} for {1}'
  - key: hud.mistakes
    text: 'Mistake: {0}'
  - key: call.title
    text: Emergency call
  - key: call.call
    text: Call
  - key: call.clear
    text: Clear
  - key: call.dispatcher
    text: '112: Wetin happen?'
  - key: call.pick_three
    text: Tell dem the 3 things wey dem need pass.
  - key: call.send
    text: Tell dem
  - key: info.location
    text: Where we dey
  - key: info.casualty_name
    text: The man full name
  - key: info.what_happened
    text: Wetin happen
  - key: info.your_shift
    text: When my shift go finish
  - key: info.breathing
    text: If e dey breathe
  - key: info.weather
    text: How weather be outside
  - key: meter.per_min
    text: every minute
  - key: meter.start
    text: Start to press the chest.
  - key: meter.count
    text: '{0} for {1}'
  - key: meter.slow
    text: E too slow. Press faster.
  - key: meter.fast
    text: E too fast. Slow down small.
  - key: meter.good
    text: Correct speed. Continue.
  - key: instr.hazards
    text: Look around. Tap the 2 danger before you go near.
  - key: instr.response
    text: Tap the two shoulder. Then shout make you see if e answer.
  - key: instr.call
    text: E no answer. Call 112, tell dem wetin dem need.
  - key: instr.breathing
    text: Hold the button. Look, listen, feel am for 5 reach 10 seconds.
  - key: instr.compressions
    text: E no dey breathe. Press middle of chest 30 times, fast and steady.
  - key: instr.recovery
    text: E dey breathe. Drag the yellow ball go the green circle, one by one.
  - key: hint.hazards
    text: Check floor around am. Water, wire, glass, gas, smoke, things wey dey move.
  - key: hint.hazards_one_more
    text: One more danger remain. Look for back and side.
  - key: hint.response
    text: Tap left shoulder, then right shoulder.
  - key: hint.shout
    text: Now press Shout.
  - key: hint.call
    text: Tap Open phone. Dial 1 1 2. Press Call.
  - key: hint.call_info
    text: 'Dem need: where, wetin happen, and breathing.'
  - key: hint.breathing
    text: Hold the button until e turn green, then leave am.
  - key: hint.compressions
    text: Tap lower middle of chest. Make am 100 reach 120 every minute.
  - key: hint.recovery.near_arm
    text: 1 of 5. Drag the yellow ball for im near hand go the green circle.
  - key: hint.recovery.far_hand
    text: 2 of 5. Drag im far hand ball go the circle near im cheek.
  - key: hint.recovery.far_knee
    text: 3 of 5. Drag the knee ball go the circle make im far knee bend.
  - key: hint.recovery.roll
    text: 4 of 5. Drag the hip ball come your side make e roll for side.
  - key: hint.recovery.head_tilt
    text: 5 of 5. Drag the head ball back make im head tilt, make air pass.
  - key: fb.timeout
    text: Time don finish for this step. Make we move.
  - key: fb.hazard_found
    text: Good. That one na danger.
  - key: fb.not_a_hazard
    text: That one no be danger. Look again.
  - key: fb.shoulder_tapped
    text: You don tap shoulder.
  - key: fb.no_response
    text: E no answer.
  - key: fb.tap_shoulders_first
    text: Tap the two shoulder first, then shout.
  - key: fb.call_connected
    text: 112 don pick.
  - key: fb.wrong_number
    text: Number no correct. Emergency number na 112.
  - key: fb.help_coming
    text: Help dey come. Stay with am.
  - key: fb.info_missing
    text: Dem need more. Where, wetin happen, breathing.
  - key: fb.info_wrong
    text: Only tell dem wetin dem need now.
  - key: fb.hold_short
    text: E too short. Check am at least 5 seconds.
  - key: fb.hold_long
    text: E too long. No pass 10 seconds.
  - key: fb.is_breathing
    text: E dey breathe well.
  - key: fb.not_breathing
    text: E no dey breathe. Start to press chest now.
  - key: fb.rhythm_off
    text: Keep am steady, 100 reach 120 every minute.
  - key: fb.hands_off_target
    text: Press the lower middle of the chest.
  - key: fb.next_round
    text: Good. Continue, another 30.
  - key: fb.drag_further
    text: Drag am reach the mark.
  - key: fb.limb_ok
    text: Good.
  - key: fb.wrong_order
    text: No be now. Follow the order.
  - key: fb.wait_tracking
    text: Point phone for the scene again.
  - key: pause.title
    text: E don pause
  - key: pause.manual
    text: Rest small. Continue when you ready.
  - key: pause.tracking
    text: Phone don lose the floor. Point am for the scene.
  - key: pause.resume
    text: Continue
  - key: pause.quit
    text: Stop, go home
  - key: pause.quit_title
    text: You wan stop am?
  - key: pause.quit_body
    text: We go save am as e no finish.
